# NO torch, NO sentence-transformers.
#
# The retriever's TEI branch (the one the external-GPU mode takes) calls the
# remote embedding endpoint through langchain's `HuggingFaceEndpointEmbeddings`
# — an HTTP client, and langchain-huggingface imports `sentence_transformers`
# LAZILY (inside the local-model class, not at module level), so the remote
# path needs neither torch nor sentence-transformers. `transformers` itself
# stays: langchain-huggingface's __init__ imports its chat models eagerly,
# and transformers works without torch.
#
# What is dropped is the LOCAL fallback (`HuggingFaceBgeEmbeddings`, the
# in-process sentence-transformers model) — it is the branch the retriever
# takes only when no embedding endpoint is configured, which the
# external-GPU mode never is. The fat image keeps it (and its torch).

